==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|enm|cruschen|t=to crush, smash, squeeze, squash}}, from {{der|en|fro|croissir|t=to crush}}, from {{der|en|LL.|*crusciō|t=to brush}}, from {{der|en|frk|*krustijan|t=to crush, squeeze, squash}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*kreustaną|t=to crush, grind, strike, smash}}.

Akin to {{cog|dum|crosen|t=to bruise, crush}}, {{cog|gml|krossen}}, {{m|gml|krȫsen|t=to break, shatter}}, {{cog|gmq-osw|krusa|t=to crush}}, {{cog|sv|krysta|t=to squeeze}}, {{cog|da|kryste|t=to squash}}, {{cog|is|kreista|t=to squeeze, squash}}, {{cog|fo|kroysta|t=to squeeze}}, {{cog|got|𐌺𐍂𐌹𐌿𐍃𐍄𐌰𐌽|t=to gnash}}.

